  "worked_solution": "We use the formula for the cross product and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|u|\\cdot |v|\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}\u2061\\theta \\cdot n \\\\  & =8\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}\u2061{100}^{\u2218}\\cdot n \\\\  & =16\\cdot (0.984\\,80\u2026)\\cdot n \\\\  & =(15.756\\,92\u2026)\\cdot n \\\\  & \u224815.8n.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
